{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The integration of AI into everyday life has already begun, including attempts to replace humans in advanced workflows. You are a robot secretary, and everyone is watching to see if you can do the job better than a human. Your task is to carry out assignments while avoiding mistakes that could jeopardize the future of all robots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693150/extras/\u041e\u043f\u0438\u0441\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435_1.png?t=1745963338\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What to do in the office?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Office routine:</strong> Watering plants, documents for signing, letters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Boss maintenance:</strong> Coffee, meetings, phone calls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PC work:</strong> Sorting, investments, editing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693150/extras/Screenshot_15.png?t=1745963338\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Strict office rules</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bonuses </strong>for flawless work and<strong> penalties </strong>for mistakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Termination </strong>if failures exceed a critical threshold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Each day brings more tasks </strong>\u2014 can you handle the pressure?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693150/extras/Screenshot_13.png?t=1745963338\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Surviving after work</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expenses:</strong> Pay for your charging dock, electricity, internet, training, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrades:</strong> Improve speed, battery life, remote control, or change your design.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3693150?t=1745963338","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693150/ebf5a08ccc328c4c74fc221a98437ae4c6128b09/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745963338","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693150/97ebfc6c7b3e43b82059110e3dbef35594d4cb28/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745963338","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693150/97ebfc6c7b3e43b82059110e3dbef35594d4cb28/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745963338","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The integration of AI into everyday life has already begun, including attempts to replace humans in advanced workflows. You are a robot secretary, and everyone is watching to see if you can do the job better than a human. Your task is to carry out assignments while avoiding mistakes that could jeopardize the future of all robots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693150/extras/\u041e\u043f\u0438\u0441\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435_1.png?t=1745963338\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What to do in the office?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Office routine:</strong> Watering plants, documents for signing, letters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Boss maintenance:</strong> Coffee, meetings, phone calls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PC work:</strong> Sorting, investments, editing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor